faint trail through the tall, wide-leafed grass which leads east and south

along the pond's shore.  To the north and west a thick line of trees rise

up, stretching towards the sky, a few scattered birds' nests nestled high

in a few odd branches.  The chattering of squirrels from above mixes with

the sounds of waterfowl on the pond, putting you at ease.  A faint path

leads north into the woods.

