#45152
"Woods - Tree-Lined Path, Near Mansion"
"A large, grand mansion lies directly to the north.  Large glass windows line

all three floors of this obvuiously opulent building.  Heavy, rich draperies

can be seen hanging in the windows of the lower floors in multiple colors. 

The house itself is most massive, and built of light grey stone.  It is

surrounded by a rather thick low grey shrub, which looks as though it has the

potential to spring up into an incredibly unkempt mass of vegitation if not

constantly maintained.  A large oak door seals the house from the outside

world.  A large path leads east-west from the house, bordered by lovely fruit

trees.

"
